==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Mandelbrot]] [[set]]|-}}

# {{mathematics}} the [[set]] of [[complex number]]s ''c'' for which the [[orbit]] of 0 under [[iteration]] of the [[complex]] [[quadratic]] [[polynomial]] ''z''<sub>''n''+1</sub> = ''z''<sub>''n''</sub><sup>2</sup> + ''c'' remains [[bounded]]. The [[boundary]] of this set is a [[fractal]].

